<title>GERMANY: Buba-bids for top-up of New Year bond due Jan 28.</title>
<headline>Buba-bids for top-up of New Year bond due Jan 28.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Bundesbank said bids for the top-up of the six-percent 2007 New Year's bond had to be in by 1000 GMT on Tuesday, January 28.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank has earlier said the top-up would be up to 10 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
